Verb Phrases
The video for “More than Words” came 
out before most of you were born.
came out + {before + most of + you + were + born}
V + {PP}
(Unpacking what’s in that PP is hard, because “most of you were born” looks like a verb phrase, but it 
specifies a point in time that complements before.)
Many verb phrases also contain noun phrases:
sang +  {the song} 
V + {NP}
worked + himself + {to death}
V + NP + {PP}
threw + {a + party} + {for + him}
V + {NP} + {PP}
